===Errors===
* When {{AP|Pikachu}} looks with perplexity at {{TP|Clemont|Chespin}} while it is hiding behind a plant, his tail is missing.
* When {{TRT}} gets through {{an|Professor Sycamore}}'s laboratory, while breaking the wall, {{p|Zigzagoon}}'s eyes disappear when they close, only leaving its mask there.
* When Ash and {{an|Clemont}} approach Chespin, the lower-left spike on its head is colored brown.
* When Chespin picks up a piece of macaron, its left arm and tail are briefly colored green.
* In the scene where [[James]] is slamming on the computer, the keyboard is drastically oversized and its touch-pad is missing.
* When James turns [[Team Rocket's mechas#Pokémon the Series: XY|Mega Mega Meowth]] on, half of [[Jessie]]'s glove is colored as her skin, making her glove appear shorter.
* After Mega Mega Meowth is hit by {{m|Flamethrower}}, Chespin's arms are colored light-brown.
* In the {{pmin|Poland|Polish}} dub, the [[Pokédex]] uses a different voice filter than usual.

